          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.14.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit 14:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wakamwambia, Mtu alitokea, akaonana nasi, akatuambia, Nendeni, rudini kwa mfalme yule aliyewatuma, mkamwambie, BWANA asema hivi Je! Ni kwa sababu hapana Mungu katika Israeli, hata mnakwenda kuuliza kwa Baal-zebubu, mungu wa Ekroni? Basi kwa ajili ya hayo hutashuka katika kile kitanda ulichokipanda, bali hakika utakufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akawaambia, Je! Mtu yule aliyetokea, akaonana nanyi, akawaambia maneno hayo, alikuwa mtu wa namna gani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
