        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo mfalme akatuma kamanda wa askari hamsini pamoja na hamsini wake, wamwendee Eliya. Akamwendea, na tazama, ameketi juu ya kilima. Akamwambia, Ewe mtu wa Mungu, mfalme asema, Shuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
